<b>5RS
Production Call Center (temp)</b>

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:16.650
We need your help for a job very soon.

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:20.990
We'll send you the storyboards and 
pre-production materials, if you can check them...

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:17.530
Even just one frame would be...

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:19.260
Our animation director mentioned your name...

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:20.990
How many cuts can you do? 
Even just one or two would help...

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:20.990
I'm sure your other jobs are waiting for you, but...

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:23.540
<i>Sorry, I can't take up work on the fly.</i>

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:25.470
<i>Will I get an overtime bonus?</i>

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:27.380
<i>I'm on maternity leave right now.</i>

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:30.750
<i>Is this the voice actor, Ishikawa-san? 
No, but call me for the afterparty!</i>

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:33.080
<i>I already have a bad back! No way!</i>

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:35.880
<i>I swore I'd never work for that 
president of yours again!</i>

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.960
<i>If you could pay me in cash, 
I might consider it...</i>

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:42.840
Well... I'll take it this time.

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:43.100
<b>Super Rich Special Animator, Mr. A</b>

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:46.860
<b>Super Rich Special Animator, Ms. B</b>

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:46.870
Yes, very well.

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:49.110
<b>Ditto, Mr. C</b>

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:49.110
Sounds interesting. I'll take it.

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:51.110
<b>Ditto, Ms. D and Chi-chan</b>

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.710
Leave it to me.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:54.110
<b>Ditto, Mr. E and ladyfriends (very close)</b>

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:54.100
I'll show you the best keyframes of my career.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:56.860
Thank you very much!

