Who came up with that premise?!

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:41.080
Yes. Gather up all 
the cranes in Tama City.

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:42.790
Nothing smaller than 20 meters.

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:44.030
Just the big cranes!

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:48.750
<b>Magical Person Watashi  #5
Master Tape</b>

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:48.750
Please be in time. We can make it!

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:52.560
<i>Look at this!</i>

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:55.250
<i>Chizilla... Chizilla has begun to move!</i>

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.860
<i>His dorsal fins are shining bright.</i>

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:59.070
<i>It's just like the time he fried the city!</i>

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:01.040
<i>Everyone, please, evacuate at once!</i>

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:08.080
What will we do?

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:09.230
A hook-and-ladder truck!

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:10.380
Now?

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:13.060
The cranes are blocking the whole road...

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:14.960
It's no use... it won't make it in time!

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:17.560
And it was such a perfect plan...

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:18.570
Damn!

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:21.130
Has God abandoned us?

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:26.840
He's gonna destroy the bridge!

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:29.220
If he makes it past the 
bridge and keeps going...

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:31.070
...the anime industry is dead.

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:35.120
No... first, that certain country's 
all-out attack will...

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:37.690
<i>We have the order to attack.</i>

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:39.050
<i>Initiate the plan.</i>

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:40.910
<i>Roger.</i>

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:49.440
Can it be... is that...

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:56.310
<b>Magical Girl Ore, Eating (Sata Andagi)</b>

00:20:57.710 --> 00:20:59.360
Let's go, Saki.

00:20:59.960 --> 00:21:00.810
'kay.

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:07.250
Jimami Tofu Kick!

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.380
We did it!

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:37.070
Oh, my God!

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.060
The hell kind of ending is this?

00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:40.030
Can they do that?

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:41.580
Well, we were almost out of time...

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:43.070
Yeah, the credits are coming up.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:44.910
All right, then...

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:46.010
We're done here!

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:49.990
<b>The End</b>

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:20.790 --> 00:23:24.710
<i>With an old mission in their hearts, Saki 
and Sakuyo slip silently out of the forest.</i>

00:23:25.150 --> 00:23:28.260
<i>But the power of love interrupts...</i>

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:31.180
<i>Next time, "Magical Girl - Hot Springs Business."</i>

00:23:29.130 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Magical Girl - Hot Springs Business</b>

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:33.190
<i>There'll be magic and wardrobe malfunctions.</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:37.980
Illustration: Monokubo
